# Another installation. Copy to fleet.d/<name>.conf (that copy is gitignored)
# and select it with LIGHTNING_FLEET=<name>.
# Same columns as fleet-nodes.conf. Leaf-first order. Wired jump node last.
# A node with no id yet is `name|-|-|model|notes` and is not rolled out.
# group defaults to house. Peers stay inside one group.
#
# name|ssh_addr|node_id|model|notes|group
